# walkbox — start the loop and let it run (2026-08-21).
#
# READ THIS IF A BODY/VOICE A/B ON THIS CART COMES BACK BYTE-IDENTICAL: a plain
# `script /dev/null` render of this cart is DIGITAL SILENCE (peak -inf), because the
# sequencer boots STOPPED. ab-render then reports "the flag did not reach the DSP",
# which is a lie — nothing reached the DSP because nothing was playing. The tell is
# that walkbox, walkroll and upright all render the SAME sha: identical silence.
#
# init() already seeds a 16-step line (don/dde/dsl/dvl/dln), so SPACE is all it takes.
down 10 SPACE
up 12 SPACE
